abstract:
  nomad-north-mpes-igor is a NOMAD NORTH plugin that layers Wine and Igor Pro on top of the
  pynxtools-mpes NORTH tool image (https://github.com/FAIRmat-NFDI/pynxtools-mpes), for ARPES
  data reduction workflows that continue in Igor after the Python-based mpes analysis steps.

  Because Igor Pro is proprietary and requires a valid license, the Igor installer and Wine
  prefix are never committed to this repository - the image has to be built manually by someone
  with a license.

  nomad-north-mpes-igor is developed as a tool within NOMAD, an open-source data management
  platform for materials science (https://nomad-lab.eu/nomad-lab/).

  The work is funded by the Deutsche Forschungsgemeinschaft (DFG, German Research Foundation) -
  460197019 (FAIRmat) (https://gepris.dfg.de/project/460197019).
license: MIT
